# remark's MDX serializer reformats JSX inside attribute values (e.g. preview={...} props),
# removing intentional indentation, and puts a JSX element's multi-line attributes on one line.
# Files listed here are excluded from remark --output and from format:mdx:check.
src/stories/guidelines/keyboard-shortcuts.mdx
src/stories/guidelines/providing-help.mdx
src/stories/guidelines/theming.mdx
src/stories/guidelines/tooltips.mdx

# Storybook build output (gitignored), which would otherwise be rewritten on every format run.
storybook-static/
